{"ts": "2026-06-06T06:50:09+00:00", "note": "DONE. Added Expr::Quaternary(subject, Option<ok>, Option<nothing>, Option<err>, Span) to ast.rs (variant + span match). pratt.rs: parse_ternary->parse_inline_handler_arms->collect_handler_arms; produces Quaternary iff a `!!` err-arm present, else Ternary (unchanged). Multiline arm form via parse_multiline_handler_arms, gated by at_multiline_arms (Newline+Indent+ `?`|`!!` ONLY \u2014 NOT bare `!`, to avoid misreading if/while bodies that start with `! expr` bang-return). Invoked from stmt/dispatch.rs bare-expr path when at_multiline_arms(). `$`=Expr::Placeholder, `err`=Expr::Ident(\"err\"); binding deferred to typer task 2-4-4. Structural Quaternary arms added: fmt.rs format_expr, resolve.rs rewrite_expr, driver/sources/implicit.rs walk_expr, parser/decl/mod.rs is_value list, typer/scc.rs collect_calls_expr. placeholder.rs needs NO arm (catch-all `_ => false`/clone is correct: quaternary `$` is success binding, must not be lifted into pipeline lambda). typer/expr/mod.rs has explicit Quaternary arm returning Err \"not yet implemented (task 2-4-4)\" \u2014 REPLACE with real lowering in 2-4-4. NOTE: statement/bind `!!`/`?...!!` still use OLD desugaring (finish_bare_handler_chain, finish_bare_bangbang, parse_bind lines ~83/177/235) producing Stmt::Match+ErrReturn \u2014 left intact so 6 integration bangbang_* tests still pass; unify into Quaternary in 2-4-4/2-4-7. 5 parser tests added (quaternary_inline_full/err_arm_only/ok_and_err_arm/multiline/without_err_arm_is_ternary). Build zero warnings. No new test regressions (11 pre-existing error-effects integration fails + 8 pre-existing typer lambda fails remain, all baseline)."}
